   "flags": {},
   "order": 19,
   "mode": 0,
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Stream and video thumbnails with your avatar\n**VTube Pro workflow, 24 GB graphics card** (Qwen-Image 2512 + Qwen-Image-Edit 2511). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nA 16:9 thumbnail: a generated background, a big title, and your avatar cut out on top.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Load a picture of your avatar in \"Your avatar\".\n2. Change the theme and the title words in \"Your prompt\".\n3. Press Run. Your avatar is cut out and placed on the right.\n4. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** 1280x720 PNG (YouTube and Twitch size).\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Take a picture of your avatar in the studio (a clean background helps), load it as \"Your avatar\", run, upload the result.\n\n**Settings:** 1664x928, 4 steps (Lightning), CFG 1; avatar cut out with BiRefNet.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [qwen_image_2512_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI) (20.4 GB) in `models/diffusion_models`: Apache-2.0\n- [Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-2512-Lightning) (0.8 GB) in `models/loras`: Apache-2.0\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI) (9.4 GB) in `models/text_encoders`: Apache-2.0\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI) (0.3 GB) in `models/vae`: Apache-2.0\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet) (0.4 GB) in `models/background_removal`: MIT\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro thumbnail workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- 3-4 big words at most. Strong contrast.\n- Your avatar's face should be large.\n- Don't use other creators' art or game key art.\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
